WEBVTT

01:00:00.000 --> 01:00:02.083
<b>I built a SimCity game over Thanksgiving.</b>

01:00:02.583 --> 01:00:02.791
<b>Look.</b>

01:00:03.041 --> 01:00:03.458
<b>All the buildings.</b>

01:00:03.666 --> 01:00:04.416
<b>Look at all the little</b>

01:00:04.416 --> 01:00:05.958
<b>people and the trains</b>

01:00:06.125 --> 01:00:07.666
<b>and the railroad crossings.</b>

01:00:08.000 --> 01:00:09.375
<b>And these are all made by Gemini.</b>

01:00:10.250 --> 01:00:11.791
<b>I love writing code.</b>

01:00:12.000 --> 01:00:13.000
<b>I love being an engineer.</b>

01:00:13.458 --> 01:00:15.208
<b>I find it really creative.</b>

01:00:15.625 --> 01:00:17.166
<b>It lets me take ideas and</b>

01:00:17.166 --> 01:00:18.125
<b>bring them into reality.</b>

01:00:18.500 --> 01:00:20.125
<b>And Cursor helped me translate these</b>

01:00:20.125 --> 01:00:21.583
<b>ambitious ideas I had</b>

01:00:21.583 --> 01:00:22.625
<b>into actual code.</b>

01:00:22.875 --> 01:00:25.583
<b>I walk into the office every day just</b>

01:00:25.583 --> 01:00:26.791
<b>being excited to use Cursor</b>

01:00:27.000 --> 01:00:28.041
<b>and write more code.</b>

01:00:28.583 --> 01:00:29.500
<b>So I think our culture is</b>

01:00:29.500 --> 01:00:30.583
<b>really built around that.</b>

01:00:30.583 --> 01:00:31.833
<b>I'm Andrew, and I work</b>

01:00:31.833 --> 01:00:32.750
<b>on the product at Cursor.</b>

01:00:33.250 --> 01:00:34.375
<b>I love working with Andrew.</b>

01:00:34.375 --> 01:00:36.250
<b>We've been working together our dire</b>

01:00:36.250 --> 01:00:37.291
<b>adult lives, basically.</b>

01:00:37.708 --> 01:00:38.041
<b>I'm Jason.</b>

01:00:38.708 --> 01:00:40.875
<b>I lead product engineering with Andrew.</b>

01:00:41.416 --> 01:00:43.416
<b>Setting the stage on our linear use,</b>

01:00:43.583 --> 01:00:44.583
<b>Cursor has a lot of products.</b>

01:00:45.000 --> 01:00:46.625
<b>We have a desktop app that</b>

01:00:46.625 --> 01:00:48.333
<b>lives on Mac, Windows, and Linux.</b>

01:00:48.750 --> 01:00:49.375
<b>We have a web app.</b>

01:00:49.708 --> 01:00:51.291
<b>We have multiple APIs, so</b>

01:00:51.291 --> 01:00:52.583
<b>for creating cloud agents,</b>

01:00:52.625 --> 01:00:54.166
<b>for managing your team.</b>

01:00:54.583 --> 01:00:55.666
<b>And then we also have integrations</b>

01:00:55.750 --> 01:00:56.875
<b>into Linear and Slack</b>

01:00:56.875 --> 01:00:57.666
<b>and some other products.</b>

01:00:58.208 --> 01:00:59.333
<b>That means that we have a</b>

01:00:59.333 --> 01:01:01.541
<b>huge array of bugs and reports</b>

01:01:01.541 --> 01:01:02.916
<b>and features that we want to be building</b>

01:01:02.916 --> 01:01:03.958
<b>across all these products.</b>
